/* Ls024 - Tail garbage after end marker
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Catalog section : §12.1c structural / framing
   Sources         : A025, N002 (notes)
   Originally also catalogued as: Ad037
   See also        : Ad080
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Defect
     Material appearing after END-ISO-10303-21; - appended log lines,
     multiple concatenated files, or stray DATA;ENDSEC; blocks. Greedy
     regex parsers may match across boundaries and pick up entities from
     the trailing garbage as if they were part of the file.
   Expected behavior
     Stop reading at the first end marker; treat trailing bytes as a
     warning and discard. Reject a second 'DATA;' at top level (after
     the proper end marker has already terminated the file).
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   This file appends a log banner and a stray DATA;ENDSEC; pair.
*/
